<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>DevBlog</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>

<body>

  <nav>
    <h2>DevBlog</h2>

    <div>
      <% if (user) { %>
        <span>Hi, <%= user %></span>
        <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/login">Login</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main>

    <section class="hero">
      <p class="tag">TECH • DEVELOPMENT • BUILDING</p>

      <h1>
        Thoughts on building
        <br />
        software.
      </h1>

      <p>
        A simple developer blog about programming,
        systems, projects and things worth building.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="posts">

      <article>
        <span>JAVASCRIPT</span>
        <h2>Understanding JavaScript Closures</h2>
        <p>
          A practical explanation of closures and why they
          matter when building JavaScript applications.
        </p>
        <a href="#">Read article →</a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>BACKEND</span>
        <h2>How Cookie Authentication Works</h2>
        <p>
          Understanding sessions, cookies and authentication
          in an Express application.
        </p>
        <a href="#">Read article →</a>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>PROJECTS</span>
        <h2>Building My First Production App</h2>
        <p>
          Lessons learned while designing and building
          a real-world full-stack application.
        </p>
        <a href="#">Read article →</a>
      </article>

    </section>

  </main>

</body>
</html>